{"id":"kJ8mPq2XvR5nT9wZ","name":"Analyze competitor Instagram Reels with Apify and save AI insights to Google Sheets","nodes":[{"id":"01","name":"01 — When Competitors Should Be Checked","type":"n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger","notes":"默认每天 09:00 跑一次。12 小时一次会让 Discovery 成本翻倍，README 有说明。","position":[0,0],"parameters":{"rule":{"interval":[{"field":"days","daysInterval":1,"triggerAtHour":9,"triggerAtMinute":0}]}},"typeVersion":1.4},{"id":"01b","name":"01b — Create Registry Table","type":"n8n-nodes-base.dataTable","notes":"去重注册表。createIfNotExists=true：第一次自动建表，之后复用。","position":[130,220],"parameters":{"columns":{"column":[{"name":"reel_key","type":"string"},{"name":"instagram_username","type":"string"},{"name":"reel_url","type":"string"},{"name":"status","type":"string"},{"name":"attempts","type":"number"},{"name":"error_code","type":"string"},{"name":"processed_at","type":"string"},{"name":"last_attempt_at","type":"string"}]},"options":{"createIfNotExists":true},"resource":"table","operation":"create","tableName":"competitor_reel_registry"},"typeVersion":1.1},{"id":"02","name":"02 — Load Competitors","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","notes":"⚠️ 需要你选自己的表格（这里是模板，documentId 留空）。整张 Competitors 表读进来，过滤 active 交给下一步的代码做（节点自带的筛选区分大小写，容易静默漏行）。","position":[260,0],"parameters":{"options":{},"sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"Competitors"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":""}},"typeVersion":4.7},{"id":"02b — Filter Active Competitors","name":"02b — Filter Active Competitors","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","notes":"容忍 active 写成 true / TRUE / yes / 1 / active，避免筛选对不上导致静默跑空。","position":[390,0],"parameters":{"mode":"runOnceForAllItems","jsCode":"// 02b — Filter Active Competitors\n// 为什么要单独一步：Google Sheets 读取节点的「筛选」是严格区分大小写的字符串比较，\n// 而表里的 active 可能是布尔 TRUE（读出来是 \"true\"）、大写 \"TRUE\"、或 \"yes\"。\n// 一旦对不上，它会「静默地」一行都不返回 —— 工作流显示跑成功了，其实什么都没做。\n// 放在代码里判断：容忍 true / TRUE / yes / y / 1 / active，并丢掉没填用户名的空行。\nconst truthy = function (v) {\n  if (v === true) return true;\n  if (v === false || v === null || v === undefined) return false;\n  const s = String(v).trim().toLowerCase();\n  return s === 'true' || s === 'yes' || s === 'y' || s === '1' || s === 'active';\n};\n\nconst out = [];\nfor (const item of $input.all()) {\n  const j = item.json || {};\n  const username = String(j.instagram_username || '').trim().replace(/^@/, '');\n  if (!username) continue;              // 没填用户名的空行，跳过\n  if (!truthy(j.active)) continue;      // 只有 active 为真的才处理\n  const n = Number(j.max_reels_per_check);\n  out.push({\n    json: Object.assign({}, j, {\n      instagram_username: username,\n      max_reels_per_check: (Number.isFinite(n) && n > 0) ? n : 3\n    })\n  });\n}\nreturn out;\n"},"notesInFlow":false,"typeVersion":2},{"id":"03","name":"03 — Loop Over Competitors","type":"n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches","position":[520,0],"parameters":{"options":{"reset":false},"batchSize":1},"typeVersion":3},{"id":"04","name":"04 — Fetch Recent Reels","type":"@apify/n8n-nodes-apify.apify","notes":"REELS DISCOVERY 模块 —— 走 Actor 的 Reels only 模式，只返回 Reels，不会夹带照片和轮播。这是唯一需要替换的一环，换成别的抓取方案即可。","position":[780,0],"parameters":{"memory":1024,"actorId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"id","value":"y3uzYAhSuIK2ad8hE"},"timeout":300,"resource":"Actors","operation":"Run actor and get dataset","customBody":"={{ JSON.stringify({ profiles: [ 'https://www.instagram.com/' + $json.instagram_username + '/' ], profileContentType: 'reels', profileResultsLimit: Math.min(($json.max_reels_per_check || 3), 20) }) }}","maxTotalChargeUsd":0.5},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"05 — Normalize Reel Data","name":"05 — Normalize Reel Data","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","notes":"安全网：挡掉万一混进来的非视频；拼 canonical URL、按时间倒序取最新 N 条。","position":[1040,0],"parameters":{"mode":"runOnceForAllItems","jsCode":"// 05 — Normalize Reel Data\n// 把 Discovery Actor 的输出收敛成「每支 Reel 一条」的干净结构。\n// Discovery 已开 Actor 的 Reels only 模式（profileContentType='reels'），正常情况下只回 Reels\n// （实测：limit=6 时回 6 条，全部 productType=clips）。\n// 下面 type==='video' 这层过滤留作安全网：万一上游被换回 all_posts 模式，\n// 照片和轮播会被挡在这里，不会白白花掉转写费。\nconst competitor = $('03 — Loop Over Competitors').item.json;\nconst maxReels = Math.min(\n  Number(competitor.max_reels_per_check) > 0 ? Number(competitor.max_reels_per_check) : 3,\n  10\n);\n\nconst rows = [];\nfor (const item of $input.all()) {\n  const j = item.json || {};\n  if (j.success !== true) continue;                 // 失败 item 直接丢\n  const c = j.content || {};\n  if (c.type !== 'video') continue;                 // 只要视频（照片/carousel 跳过）\n  const shortcode = c.shortcode;\n  if (!shortcode) continue;\n\n  // competitor 身份：优先用 Competitors 表里的用户名（用户填的），\n  // 而不是 inputUrl，避免 URL 形态差异；author.username 作为兜底。\n  const username = competitor.instagram_username\n    || (j.author && j.author.username)\n    || '';\n\n  rows.push({\n    json: {\n      reel_key: username + ':' + shortcode,\n      instagram_username: username,\n      shortcode,\n      // canonical URL 由我们自己拼 —— 不信任 Actor 给的 normalizedUrl（/p/ 与 /reel/ 会漂）\n      reel_url: 'https://www.instagram.com/reel/' + shortcode + '/',\n      caption: c.caption || '',\n      published_at: c.publishedAt || '',\n      duration: (c.durationSeconds === undefined ? null : c.durationSeconds),\n      media_type: c.type,\n      like_count: (j.engagement && j.engagement.likeCount) ?? null,\n      comment_count: (j.engagement && j.engagement.commentCount) ?? null,\n      discovered_from: j.inputUrl || '',\n      max_reels_per_check: maxReels\n    }\n  });\n}\n\n// 按发布时间倒序 → 取最新 N 条（这也天然满足「第一次运行只处理最近的」）\nrows.sort((a, b) => String(b.json.published_at).localeCompare(String(a.json.published_at)));\nreturn rows.slice(0, maxReels);\n"},"notesInFlow":false,"typeVersion":2},{"id":"06 — Prepare Reel Queue","name":"06 — Prepare Reel Queue","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","notes":"跨 competitor 二次去重（collab 转发会让同一支 Reel 出现两次）。","position":[1300,0],"parameters":{"mode":"runOnceForAllItems","jsCode":"// 06 — Prepare Reel Queue\n// 跨 competitor 的二次去重：两个号可能转发同一支 Reel（collab post 常见）。\n// 同一个 reel_key 在同一轮里只能出现一次。\nconst seen = new Set();\nconst out = [];\nfor (const item of $input.all()) {\n  const k = item.json.reel_key;\n  if (!k || seen.has(k)) continue;\n  seen.add(k);\n  out.push(item);\n}\nreturn out;\n"},"notesInFlow":false,"typeVersion":2},{"id":"07","name":"07 — Loop Over Reels","type":"n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches","position":[1560,0],"parameters":{"options":{"reset":false},"batchSize":1},"typeVersion":3},{"id":"08","name":"08 — Already Processed?","type":"n8n-nodes-base.dataTable","notes":"查去重注册表。按 reel_key 精确匹配。必须开 alwaysOutputData，否则首次运行会静默断流。","position":[1820,0],"parameters":{"filters":{"conditions":[{"keyName":"reel_key","keyValue":"={{ $json.reel_key }}","condition":"eq"}]},"resource":"row","matchType":"allConditions","operation":"get","returnAll":true,"dataTableId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"competitor_reel_registry"}},"typeVersion":1.1,"alwaysOutputData":true},{"id":"09 — Is New Or Retryable?","name":"09 — Is New Or Retryable?","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","notes":"new / retry → 继续处理；skip / dead → 回循环。","position":[2080,0],"parameters":{"mode":"runOnceForAllItems","jsCode":"// 09 — Is New Or Retryable?\n// 结合 §E.3 的判定逻辑与注册表记录，决定这条 Reel 该处理还是跳过。\n// DataTable 没有唯一约束，所以「先查后写」必须由我们自己做。\nconst reel = $('07 — Loop Over Reels').item.json;\nconst found = $input.all().filter(i => i.json && i.json.reel_key === reel.reel_key);\n\nconst maxAttempts = 3;\nlet decision = 'new';\nlet reason = 'not in registry';\n\nif (found.length > 0) {\n  const rec = found[0].json;\n  const attempts = Number(rec.attempts) || 0;\n  if (rec.status === 'success') {\n    decision = 'skip';\n    reason = 'already processed successfully';\n  } else if (attempts >= maxAttempts) {\n    decision = 'dead';\n    reason = 'failed and attempts >= ' + maxAttempts;\n  } else {\n    decision = 'retry';\n    reason = 'previous attempt failed, attempts=' + attempts;\n  }\n}\n\nreturn [{\n  json: Object.assign({}, reel, {\n    _decision: decision,\n    _reason: reason,\n    _attempts: found.length > 0 ? (Number(found[0].json.attempts) || 0) : 0\n  })\n}];\n"},"notesInFlow":false,"typeVersion":2},{"id":"09b","name":"09b — Should Process?","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","position":[2340,0],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"version":2,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"loose"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"cond-decision","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"notEquals"},"leftValue":"={{ $json._decision }}","rightValue":"skip"}]}},"typeVersion":2.3},{"id":"10","name":"10 — Run Instagram Transcript Actor","type":"@apify/n8n-nodes-apify.apify","notes":"核心 Actor。1 条 Reel 跑 1 次，保证结果与错误一一对应。enhancedMode 默认 true：只在常规解析失败后才启用，且只在成功时多收 $0.008，失败不收。","onError":"continueErrorOutput","position":[2600,440],"parameters":{"memory":512,"actorId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"id","value":"ZuAmrsZhEP0VQ7E9o"},"timeout":600,"resource":"Actors","operation":"Run actor and get dataset","customBody":"={{ JSON.stringify({ urls: [ $json.reel_url ], formats: [ 'text' ], includeMediaMetadata: true, enhancedMode: true }) }}","maxTotalChargeUsd":0.5},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"11 — Validate Transcript","name":"11 — Validate Transcript","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[2860,440],"parameters":{"mode":"runOnceForAllItems","jsCode":"// 11 — Validate Transcript\n// Actor 单条失败会返回一条失败 item（run 仍是 SUCCEEDED），这里把它规范化。\n// 实测：不存在的 shortcode → media_not_found / MEDIA_NOT_FOUND / retryable=false\nconst reel = $('09 — Is New Or Retryable?').item.json;\nconst items = $input.all().map(i => i.json).filter(j => j && typeof j === 'object');\n\nif (items.length === 0) {\n  return [{ json: Object.assign({}, reel, {\n    ok: false, error_code: 'NO_ITEM_RETURNED', retryable: true,\n    error_message: 'Actor returned no dataset items' }) }];\n}\n\nconst r = items[0];\nconst status = r.status || 'error';\nconst err = r.error || {};\nconst text = (r.transcript && r.transcript.text) ? String(r.transcript.text).trim() : '';\n\nif (r.success !== true || text === '') {\n  // no_speech 表示媒体取到了但没人声，重试通常也没用 → 视为不可重试\n  const retryable = (status === 'no_speech') ? false : (err.retryable !== false);\n  return [{ json: Object.assign({}, reel, {\n    ok: false,\n    transcript_status: status,\n    error_code: err.code || status.toUpperCase(),\n    error_message: err.message || status,\n    retryable: retryable,\n    // 中文说明：transcript 为空不代表 Reel 无效，但无法做内容分析\n    empty_transcript: text === ''\n  }) }];\n}\n\nconst meta = r.media || {};\nconst content = r.content || {};\nreturn [{ json: Object.assign({}, reel, {\n  ok: true,\n  transcript_status: status,\n  transcript: text,\n  transcript_language: (r.transcript && r.transcript.language) || null,\n  duration: (content.durationSeconds === undefined ? reel.duration : content.durationSeconds),\n  caption: reel.caption || content.caption || '',\n  // 媒体链接是临时 CDN（mediaUrlsTemporary），不写进结果表长期保存\n  _media_is_temporary: meta.mediaUrlsTemporary === true\n}) }];\n"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"12","name":"12 — Analyze Reel With AI","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm","notes":"系统提示在 Chat Messages 里（System 类型），不要在 Prompt 字段里重复。","onError":"continueErrorOutput","position":[3120,440],"parameters":{"text":"=Now analyze this competitor Reel.\n\nREEL:\n{{ JSON.stringify({ instagram_username: $json.instagram_username, reel_url: $json.reel_url, caption: $json.caption, transcript: $json.transcript, transcript_language: $json.transcript_language, duration: $json.duration, published_at: $json.published_at }) }}\n\nReturn the json object now.","messages":{"messageValues":[{"type":"SystemMessagePromptTemplate","message":"You are analyzing a competitor's Instagram Reel for content strategy research.\n\nAnalyze ONLY evidence contained in:\n- Reel caption\n- Transcript\n- Available metadata\n\nDo not invent engagement results or business facts that aren't present.\n\nIdentify:\n1. What is the first hook?\n2. What hook style is used?\n3. What is the core topic?\n4. What problem or desire is addressed?\n5. What is the main message?\n6. What CTA is used?\n7. What emotional trigger is present?\n8. Why might the creative/message be effective?\n9. How can the underlying idea be adapted WITHOUT copying?\n10. Generate 3 original hook alternatives.\n11. Generate 3 adjacent content ideas.\n\nWe are NOT helping the user plagiarise. Learn from structure / angle / messaging\nand produce ORIGINAL ideas.\n\nReturn ONLY a single json object. No markdown code fences, no commentary.\nEvery key below MUST be present. Use null when the evidence is absent.\nDo not fabricate view counts or engagement numbers.\n\n{\n  \"summary\": string,\n  \"hook\": string,\n  \"hook_type\": string,\n  \"topic\": string,\n  \"content_angle\": string,\n  \"target_audience\": string,\n  \"pain_point\": string,\n  \"key_message\": string,\n  \"cta\": string,\n  \"emotion\": string,\n  \"content_format\": string,\n  \"why_it_may_work\": string,\n  \"three_rewritten_hooks\": [string, string, string],\n  \"three_content_ideas\": [string, string, string],\n  \"language\": string,\n  \"confidence\": number\n}"}]},"promptType":"define"},"typeVersion":1.9},{"id":"12b","name":"12b — DeepSeek (OpenAI-compatible)","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi","notes":"这是 OpenAI Chat Model 节点，Base URL 指向 DeepSeek（在凭据里填，见 README）。所以凭据类型是 openAiApi，不是 deepSeekApi。model 必须显式写 deepseek-flash；responsesApiEnabled 必须关；extraBody 传 thinking disabled 关掉思考（这是实测最快的配置）。","position":[3120,880],"parameters":{"model":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"deepseek-flash"},"options":{"extraBody":"{\"thinking\": {\"type\": \"disabled\"}}","maxTokens":4000,"responseFormat":"json_object"},"responsesApiEnabled":false},"typeVersion":1.3},{"id":"13 — Validate AI Output","name":"13 — Validate AI Output","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[3380,440],"parameters":{"mode":"runOnceForAllItems","jsCode":"// 13 — Validate AI Output\n// AI 返回的是解析好的对象（chainLlm + json_object），这里做字段兜底。\nconst reel = $('11 — Validate Transcript').item.json;\nconst REQUIRED = ['summary','hook','hook_type','topic','content_angle','target_audience',\n  'pain_point','key_message','cta','emotion','content_format','why_it_may_work',\n  'three_rewritten_hooks','three_content_ideas','language','confidence'];\n\nconst raw = $input.first().json || {};\n// 有的情况模型会把结果包一层 { output: {...} }\nconst ai = (raw.output && typeof raw.output === 'object') ? raw.output : raw;\n\nconst missing = REQUIRED.filter(k => ai[k] === undefined || ai[k] === null || ai[k] === '');\nconst asText = v => Array.isArray(v) ? v.filter(Boolean).map(s => '- ' + s).join('\\n') : (v == null ? '' : String(v));\n\nreturn [{ json: Object.assign({}, reel, {\n  ai_ok: missing.length === 0,\n  ai_missing_fields: missing,\n  summary: ai.summary || '',\n  hook: ai.hook || '',\n  hook_type: ai.hook_type || '',\n  topic: ai.topic || '',\n  content_angle: ai.content_angle || '',\n  target_audience: ai.target_audience || '',\n  pain_point: ai.pain_point || '',\n  key_message: ai.key_message || '',\n  cta: ai.cta || '',\n  emotion: ai.emotion || '',\n  content_format: ai.content_format || '',\n  why_it_may_work: ai.why_it_may_work || '',\n  three_rewritten_hooks: asText(ai.three_rewritten_hooks),\n  three_content_ideas: asText(ai.three_content_ideas),\n  ai_language: ai.language || '',\n  confidence: (typeof ai.confidence === 'number') ? ai.confidence : null,\n  processed_at: new Date().toISOString()\n}) }];\n"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"14","name":"14 — Save Reel Intelligence","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","notes":"⚠️ 需要选你自己的表格。按 reel_key 做 appendOrUpdate。表头（列名）必须先建好，且必须有 reel_key 这一列；多余字段被丢弃（ignoreIt）。","onError":"continueErrorOutput","position":[3640,440],"parameters":{"columns":{"value":{},"schema":[{"id":"reel_key","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"reel_key","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"instagram_username","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"instagram_username","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"shortcode","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"shortcode","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"reel_url","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"reel_url","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"published_at","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"published_at","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"duration","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"duration","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"media_type","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"media_type","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"like_count","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"like_count","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"comment_count","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"comment_count","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"ai_language","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"ai_language","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"confidence","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"confidence","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"ai_ok","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"ai_ok","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"summary","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"summary","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"hook","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"hook","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"hook_type","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"hook_type","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"topic","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"topic","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"content_angle","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"content_angle","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"target_audience","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"target_audience","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"pain_point","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"pain_point","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"key_message","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"key_message","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"cta","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"cta","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"emotion","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"emotion","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"content_format","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"content_format","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"why_it_may_work","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"why_it_may_work","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"three_rewritten_hooks","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"three_rewritten_hooks","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"three_content_ideas","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"three_content_ideas","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"transcript","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"transcript","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"transcript_language","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"transcript_language","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"caption","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"caption","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"processed_at","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"processed_at","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true}],"mappingMode":"autoMapInputData","matchingColumns":["reel_key"]},"options":{"handlingExtraData":"ignoreIt"},"dataMode":"autoMapInputData","operation":"appendOrUpdate","sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"Reel Intelligence"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":""}},"typeVersion":4.7},{"id":"15","name":"15 — Mark As Processed","type":"n8n-nodes-base.dataTable","notes":"只在第 14 步成功后才写 success —— 这样 AI 临时失败下次会命中 retry 而不是被永久判成功。","position":[3900,440],"parameters":{"columns":{"value":{"status":"success","attempts":"={{ ($json._attempts || 0) + 1 }}","reel_key":"={{ $json.reel_key }}","reel_url":"={{ $json.reel_url }}","error_code":"","processed_at":"={{ $json.processed_at }}","last_attempt_at":"={{ $json.processed_at }}","instagram_username":"={{ $json.instagram_username }}"},"mappingMode":"defineBelow"},"filters":{"conditions":[{"keyName":"reel_key","keyValue":"={{ $json.reel_key }}","condition":"eq"}]},"resource":"row","operation":"upsert","dataTableId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"competitor_reel_registry"}},"typeVersion":1.1},{"id":"16","name":"16 — Record Failure","type":"n8n-nodes-base.dataTable","notes":"失败记录 attempts+1，允许后续重试（上限 3 次）。","position":[2860,880],"parameters":{"columns":{"value":{"status":"failed","attempts":"={{ ($json._attempts || 0) + 1 }}","reel_key":"={{ $json.reel_key }}","reel_url":"={{ $json.reel_url }}","error_code":"={{ $json.error_code || 'UNKNOWN' }}","processed_at":"","last_attempt_at":"={{ new Date().toISOString() }}","instagram_username":"={{ $json.instagram_username }}"},"mappingMode":"defineBelow"},"filters":{"conditions":[{"keyName":"reel_key","keyValue":"={{ $json.reel_key }}","condition":"eq"}]},"resource":"row","operation":"upsert","dataTableId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"competitor_reel_registry"}},"typeVersion":1.1},{"id":"17 — Build Run Digest","name":"17 — Build Run Digest","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[4160,0],"parameters":{"mode":"runOnceForAllItems","jsCode":"// 17 — Build Run Digest\n// 汇总本轮运行，供 Telegram 摘要（或人工查看）。\n//\n// ⚠️ 这里有两个坑，都不能用裸的 $('节点名').all()：\n//\n// 坑 1（会打断整个工作流）：节点本轮没执行过时（典型：本轮零失败，\n// 「16 — Record Failure」一次都没跑），$('...') 会抛\n// \"Node 'xxx' hasn't been executed\"，摘要节点直接报错。\n//\n// 坑 2（会漏计数，更隐蔽）：本工作流在循环里逐条处理 Reel，\n// 循环每一小批 = 上游节点的一次独立 run。$('节点').all() 不带 runIndex\n// 时只返回「最近一次 run」的输出 —— 循环跑了 N 批就只数到最后 1 条。\n// （n8n 源码 workflow-data-proxy.js：runIndex 缺省用 defaultReturnRunIndex。）\n//\n// 解法：按 runIndex 0,1,2,... 逐次枚举，把所有批次加起来。\n// 用 $('节点').all(0, r) 显式指定第 r 次 run。三种边界（已对 n8n 2.42.6\n// 源码 getNodeExecutionData 逐一核实）：\n//   - r 超过实际批次数     → 抛 \"Run r of node ... not found\"  → 枚举结束\n//   - 该批输出 0 条（空批） → 抛 \"No data found from `main` input\" → 批存在，跳过继续\n//   - 节点整轮没跑过       → 抛 \"Node '...' hasn't been executed\" → 视为空数组\nconst collectAllRuns = (nodeName) => {\n  const out = [];\n  for (let r = 0; r < 1000; r++) {\n    let items;\n    try {\n      items = $(nodeName).all(0, r);\n    } catch (e) {\n      const msg = String((e && e.message) || e);\n      if (msg.includes('No data found from `main` input')) continue; // 空批：批存在但 0 条\n      break;                                                          // 枚举结束 / 节点没跑过\n    }\n    if (Array.isArray(items)) out.push(...items);\n  }\n  return out.map(i => i.json);\n};\n\nconst all = collectAllRuns('13 — Validate AI Output');\nconst failed = collectAllRuns('16 — Record Failure');\n\nconst ok = all.filter(j => j && j.ai_ok === true);\nconst degraded = all.filter(j => j && j.ai_ok === false);\n\nconst byCompetitor = {};\nfor (const j of ok) {\n  const u = j.instagram_username || '(unknown)';\n  byCompetitor[u] = (byCompetitor[u] || 0) + 1;\n}\n\nreturn [{ json: {\n  run_at: new Date().toISOString(),\n  analyzed: ok.length,\n  analyzed_with_missing_fields: degraded.length,\n  failed: failed.length,\n  by_competitor: byCompetitor,\n  note: 'Views/likes are best-effort; Instagram returns null for most engagement fields without login.'\n} }];\n"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"18","name":"18 — IF Telegram Enabled","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","notes":"默认关闭。要开就设置环境变量 TELEGRAM_ENABLED=true 并配 Telegram 凭据。","position":[4420,0],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"version":2,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"loose"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"cond-tg","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"equals"},"leftValue":"false","rightValue":"true"}]}},"typeVersion":2.3},{"id":"19","name":"19 — Send Telegram Digest","type":"n8n-nodes-base.telegram","disabled":true,"position":[4680,0],"parameters":{"text":"=Competitor Reels run {{ $json.run_at }}\nanalyzed: {{ $json.analyzed }}\nfailed: {{ $json.failed }}\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.by_competitor) }}","chatId":"","additionalFields":{}},"typeVersion":1.2},{"id":"sticky-71f921","name":"Sticky Note 71f921","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[0,-1254],"parameters":{"color":1,"width":640,"height":620,"content":"### Turn competitor Instagram Reels into an AI content brief in Google Sheets\n\nThis workflow watches a list of competitor Instagram accounts, picks up the Reels they publish, transcribes the audio, and asks an AI model to turn each Reel into a structured content brief saved to a Google Sheet. Every Reel is analysed once — anything already processed in an earlier run is skipped.\n\n**Who it's for**\nSocial media managers, creators and growth teams who want to learn from competitors' Reels without scrolling and taking notes by hand.\n\n**How it works**\n1. A schedule trigger starts the run (default: daily at 09:00).\n2. Competitor handles are read from the \"Competitors\" sheet and filtered on the active flag.\n3. The [Apify Instagram Reels Downloader](https://apify.com/lance_api/instagram-reels-downloader-api) runs in Reels-only mode, so each competitor's latest Reels are fetched directly — no photo or carousel posts mixed in.\n4. Reels already seen are skipped through a deduplication registry kept in an n8n Data Table, so no extra database is needed.\n5. The [Apify Instagram Video AI Transcript](https://apify.com/lance_api/instagram-video-ai-transcript-scraper-api) actor turns each new Reel's audio into text.\n6. An AI model returns one brief per Reel: summary, hook, hook type, topic, angle, audience, pain point, key message, CTA, emotion, format, plus three rewritten hooks and three adjacent content ideas.\n7. Briefs are appended to the \"Reel Intelligence\" sheet. A failed Reel is recorded and retried on the next run instead of blocking the batch.\n\n**How to set up**\n1. Install the Apify community node (self-hosted: Settings → Community nodes).\n2. Create the two sheet tabs with the exact headers listed in the setup sticky note.\n3. Attach credentials to the Apify, Google Sheets and AI model nodes, then add the competitor accounts you want to track.\n4. Run the workflow once manually to confirm rows land in the output sheet, then activate it.\n\n**Requirements**\n* An Apify account — the two Actors used here are paid per event. A typical run of 8 short Reels costs roughly $0.04.\n* A Google account with Google Sheets access.\n* An OpenAI-compatible API key for the analysis step (DeepSeek by default).\n* The Apify community node (`@apify/n8n-nodes-apify`) installed on your instance.\n\n**How to customise**\n* Swap the Actor IDs in the two Apify nodes to run any other Apify Actor.\n* Point the model node at any OpenAI-compatible endpoint. The Telegram digest node is disabled by default."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"sticky-4c0841","name":"Sticky Note 4c0841","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[0,-297],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":460,"height":200,"content":"## SETUP\nAttach Google Sheets, Apify and model credentials here.\nAdd the accounts you want to track to the Competitors sheet."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"sticky-ec678c","name":"Sticky Note ec678c","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[780,-297],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":420,"height":200,"content":"## REELS DISCOVERY\nThe only swappable step (node 04).\nReplacing it with another source does not affect downstream nodes."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"sticky-7b9335","name":"Sticky Note 7b9335","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1820,-297],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":420,"height":200,"content":"## DEDUPLICATION\nData Table registry, created by the workflow itself.\nA Reel is only marked done after it is actually saved."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"sticky-6fbb52","name":"Sticky Note 6fbb52","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[2600,121.00000000000001],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":420,"height":160,"content":"## INSTAGRAM TRANSCRIPT\nOne Actor run per Reel."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"sticky-708b66","name":"Sticky Note 708b66","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[3120,121.00000000000001],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":420,"height":160,"content":"## AI ANALYSIS\nReturns a structured 16-field JSON brief."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"sticky-e47c06","name":"Sticky Note e47c06","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[3640,121.00000000000001],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":380,"height":160,"content":"## OUTPUT\nAppends one row per Reel to the Reel Intelligence sheet."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"sticky-94fdbb","name":"Sticky Note 94fdbb","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[4472,-297],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":380,"height":160,"content":"## OPTIONAL TELEGRAM\nDisabled by default."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"sticky-f9a2a7","name":"Sticky Note f9a2a7","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[2730,792],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":420,"height":160,"content":"## ERROR PATH\nA failure bumps the attempt counter and is retried next run.\nOne bad Reel never stops the batch."},"typeVersion":1}],"settings":{"executionOrder":"v1"},"connections":{"16 — Record Failure":{"main":[[{"node":"07 — Loop Over Reels","type":"main","index":0}]]},"07 — Loop Over Reels":{"main":[[{"node":"17 — Build Run Digest","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"08 — Already Processed?","type":"main","index":0}]]},"02 — Load Competitors":{"main":[[{"node":"02b — Filter Active Competitors","type":"main","index":0}]]},"09b — Should Process?":{"main":[[{"node":"10 — Run Instagram Transcript Actor","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"07 — Loop Over Reels","type":"main","index":0}]]},"17 — Build Run Digest":{"main":[[{"node":"18 — IF Telegram Enabled","type":"main","index":0}]]},"15 — Mark As Processed":{"main":[[{"node":"07 — Loop Over Reels","type":"main","index":0}]]},"04 — Fetch Recent Reels":{"main":[[{"node":"05 — Normalize Reel Data","type":"main","index":0}]]},"06 — Prepare Reel Queue":{"main":[[{"node":"07 — Loop Over Reels","type":"main","index":0}]]},"08 — Already Processed?":{"main":[[{"node":"09 — Is New Or Retryable?","type":"main","index":0}]]},"13 — Validate AI Output":{"main":[[{"node":"14 — Save Reel Intelligence","type":"main","index":0}]]},"05 — Normalize Reel Data":{"main":[[{"node":"03 — Loop Over Competitors","type":"main","index":0}]]},"11 — Validate Transcript":{"main":[[{"node":"12 — Analyze Reel With AI","type":"main","index":0}]]},"18 — IF Telegram Enabled":{"main":[[{"node":"19 — Send Telegram Digest","type":"main","index":0}],[]]},"09 — Is New Or Retryable?":{"main":[[{"node":"09b — Should Process?","type":"main","index":0}]]},"12 — Analyze Reel With AI":{"main":[[{"node":"13 — Validate AI Output","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"16 — Record Failure","type":"main","index":0}]]},"03 — Loop Over Competitors":{"main":[[{"node":"06 — Prepare Reel Queue","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"04 — Fetch Recent Reels","type":"main","index":0}]]},"01b — Create Registry Table":{"main":[[{"node":"02 — Load Competitors","type":"main","index":0}]]},"14 — Save Reel Intelligence":{"main":[[{"node":"15 — Mark As Processed","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"16 — Record Failure","type":"main","index":0}]]},"02b — Filter Active Competitors":{"main":[[{"node":"03 — Loop Over Competitors","type":"main","index":0}]]},"12b — DeepSeek (OpenAI-compatible)":{"ai_languageModel":[[{"node":"12 — Analyze Reel With AI","type":"ai_languageModel","index":0}]]},"10 — Run Instagram Transcript Actor":{"main":[[{"node":"11 — Validate Transcript","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"16 — Record Failure","type":"main","index":0}]]},"01 — When Competitors Should Be Checked":{"main":[[{"node":"01b — Create Registry Table","type":"main","index":0}]]}}}